## 🚀 Deployment Steps

### 1. Deploy MySQL
kubectl apply -f mysql-deployment.yml  
kubectl apply -f mysql-svc.yml  

### 2. Deploy Flask App
kubectl apply -f two-tier-app-deployment.yml  

### 3. Expose Application
kubectl apply -f two-tier-app-svc.yml  

